# 默认不公开研究原件、个案数据、私密配置与运行缓存
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/runs/
**/assets/fulltext/*
**/assets/raw_data/*
**/evidence_store/*
**/private/*
*.dta
*.sav
*.por
*.parquet
*.sqlite
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# GitHub 阅读快照保留目录占位及一份阶段验收摘要
!**/.gitkeep

# I21: new raw runs and local authentication material stay local.
**/runs_dev/
**/.codex/
**/.ssh/
**/.aws/
**/.gnupg/
**/auth.json
**/login.json
**/credentials.json
**/token.json
**/tokens.json
**/secrets.json
**/events.jsonl
**/stderr.log
**/stdout.log
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
